  <SCPLegion.SCPModManager.SearchHelp>Type words to match mod names, authors and package ids. Every word has to match.\n\nFilters:\n  author:name  (or a:)\n  id:package.id\n  desc:text  (description)\n  ver:1.5  (declares support for a game version)\n  list:name  (in a saved profile)\n  tag:name  (Steam Workshop tag)\n  is:active, inactive, compatible, outdated, newer, issues, warnings, update, steam, local, official, dlc, core, settings, localcopy, duplicate, missing, inlist, unlisted\n\nPut phrases in quotes ("pawn rules"), start a term with - to exclude it (-is:steam), and separate alternatives with commas (is:steam,local).\n\nCtrl+F jumps to the search box, Ctrl+1…5 switch pages.</SCPLegion.SCPModManager.SearchHelp>
